# #1099 Stage 3 groundwork, second probe: a hidden marker beside a picture, and Enter after a heading.
w 4
q {TAB}
w 2
q +{TAB}
w 3
k %y
w 4
# The picture line: is the hidden marker spoken? Then across it by character.
k ^{HOME}
w 2
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {END}
w 3
k {LEFT}
w 4
k {LEFT}
w 4
k {LEFT}
w 4
k {RIGHT}
w 4
k {RIGHT}
w 4
# Enter at the end of the heading, then type: what style does the new line get? (see the dump)
k ^{HOME}
w 2
k {END}
w 2
k {ENTER}
w 3
t after heading
w 3
# A new bullet: End of "Second bullet", Enter, type, Enter twice to leave the list.
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
w 3
k {END}
w 2
k {ENTER}
w 3
t third
w 3
k {ENTER}
w 3
k {ENTER}
w 3
t out of the list
w 3
